 "provenance": "Angkor 11 (secret stage, w0 l10) secret exit 43,27, control-only on the exact S700 core. Start values: lives 12, maxHealth 4 and diamonds 82 / redDiamonds 10 are the values of the old approved route (the diamond/red totals do not affect this stage: the magic diamond lock counter field_156 starts at 60 and counts only diamonds picked up in the stage); weaponTier 1 (hammer, owned since Angkor 4; secret stages are reached later in the campaign). The hook is NOT needed and no weapon is used at all. Route (1752 ticks, no resets): walk-in to checkpoint #0 (2,19); detour to the bottom-left room for the diamond chests 4,26 and 6,26 (+40) and the extra-life chest 5,25; back to 2,19 and wait so the arrow traps are in the same phase as the previous exact-core route; then that route (no actions): loose diamonds 5-7,19 and 10,20, stone drop at 11,21 (-2 hp), 13,24, 12,18, 14,18, checkpoint #1 16,13, diamonds on rows 8-9 at x 17-21 (arrow hit at 21,7, -1 hp), 26-28,8-9, checkpoint #2 29,9, diamonds 34,10-11, 35,12, 27,13-14, 26,15, 34,16-17, 35,18 (68 stage diamonds; the magic lock at 42,27 disappears at 60). Then push the row-18 stone left to 30,18 so it drops onto the stone at 30,19; cut grass 29,20, 28,20, 28,21 and leave the diamond at 28,22 so that stone rolls off it to 27,22; open the gold-key chest 26,22 from above; collect 28,22, cut grass 29,22 (the stone 29,21 falls behind), open the gold lock 33,20 from 32,20, checkpoint #3 34,21, walk 42,26 -> 42,27 -> secret exit 43,27. Built from attempts/a11-goldkey.json (earlier session) + attempts/a11-dia69-w1.json.",
